`test/cli/init.ts` (`initLoginRepo`)
**Spec:** `spec/14-doctor-init-skill.md` 2.3 (2.3.1 to 2.3.3), 3
(`src/config/starter.ts`, `src/cli/init.ts`), 5 (init and starter);
`spec/12-gate.md` 2.13 (`ensureStateIgnored` from `init`);
